WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Alternator rotor
What it does: Produces a rotating magnetic field that enables electricity generation in the stator.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Alternator rotor
How it works: The belt turns the magnetised rotor.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Alternator rotor
How it moves: Turns together with the alternator shaft and pulley.
